@startuml PASTI_Sequence_AddTeacher
title PASTI - Sequence Diagram: Admin Adds a New Teacher

actor Admin
participant "Dashboard.jsx\n(handleAddTeacher)" as UI
participant "Firebase Auth" as Auth
participant "Firestore\n(users collection)" as DB

Admin -> UI : Fill teacher form (name, IC, etc.)\n+ click "Save Profile"
activate UI

UI -> UI : validate fields\n(IC 12 digits, phone format)
UI -> UI : generateCredentials(firstName, lastName, ic)\n-> username, email, password

UI -> Auth : createUserWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)
activate Auth
note right
  This signs Firebase Auth in
  as the NEW teacher, replacing
  the admin's active session.
end note
Auth --> UI : new teacher UID
deactivate Auth

UI -> DB : setDoc(users/{uid}, {\n  role: "teacher", active: true,\n  name, ic, qualifications, ... })
activate DB
DB --> UI : write confirmed
deactivate DB

UI -> Auth : signInWithEmailAndPassword(adminEmail, adminPassword)
activate Auth
note right
  adminPassword was cached in
  sessionStorage at admin login,
  used here to restore the
  admin's own session.
end note
Auth --> UI : admin session restored
deactivate Auth

UI -> DB : fetchAdminData(adminUid)
DB --> UI : admin profile
UI -> DB : fetchAllData()\n(classrooms, users, syllabus,\nstudents, progress)
DB --> UI : refreshed lists

UI -> Admin : show success message\n"Teacher {username} created!\nPassword: {password}"
deactivate UI

@enduml
